### ➕ Add/Upsert Candidate
POST http://localhost:5000/api/candidates
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Anurag",
  "experience": 5,
  "skills": ["Python", "SQL"],
  "qualification": "B.Tech",
  "certifications": ["AWS"],
  "job_id": "JOB123"
}

### 📋 Get All Candidates
GET http://localhost:5000/api/candidates

### 🎯 Get Candidates by Job ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/candidates/job/JOB123

### ❌ Reject Candidate for a Job
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/candidates/{{candidateId}}/job/JOB123

### ➕ Add Job Listing
POST http://localhost:5000/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "job_description": "Backend Developer role",
  "location": "Bangalore",
  "employment_type": "Full-time",
  "role": "Backend Developer",
  "experience": 3,
  "skillset": ["Node.js", "MongoDB", "Express"]
}

### 📋 Get All Job Listings
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs
